apacity] 1g [Options] warm shading cool shading #Good Price #Good Quality #Korean Cosmetics #K-Beauty ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 50.0, 49.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Face', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rbln-lpq5w26nna2te6', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F24855073368', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
